    <node id="paper-0001::claim-01">
      <data key="d0">Claim</data>
      <data key="d1">MBSE creates a system model that integrates discipline-specific engineering models/simulations and provides a cohesive, consistent source of requirements, design, analysis, and verification across development.</data>
      <data key="d3">paper-0001</data>
      <data key="d4">Unsupported</data>
      <data key="d5">MBSE creates a system model that integrates discipline-specific engineering models/simulations and provides a cohesive, consistent source of requirements, design, analysis, and verification across development.</data>
    </node>
