      <data key="d7">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d8">Abstract: "MBSE creates a system model that helps integrate other discipline specific engineering models and simulations." Current Phase: "it is possible to interface SysML with special purpose M&amp;S tools in order to model a space mission and carry out trades studies."</data>
