      <data key="d6">HAS_CLAIM</data>
      <data key="d7">claimed_outcomes_value_mechanisms_evidence[]</data>
      <data key="d8">"The integration of formal methods into the design process of a complex system can reduce the need for a significant amount testing during the system integration phase because of the "correct by construction" nature of the process. This leads to testing virtually at each level of refinement."</data>
