    <edge source="paper-0008::claim-01" target="outcomecategory::decision_support" id="e000398">
      <data key="d6">CLAIMS_OUTCOME</data>
      <data key="d10">decision support</data>
      <data key="d8">Abstract: 'A cost model in the form of parametric, cost estimating relationships (CERs) is described here and is planned to be integrated with the system model architecture to provide an "up to the minute" total project cost estimate, with emphasis on assessment at the conceptual design phase.' Section 3: 'it is critical to have cost estimation capabilities throughout the mission lifecycle allowing trades to be conducted between cost, system performance, schedule and risk.'</data>
      <data key="d9">medium</data>
    </edge>
