      <data key="d6">CLAIMS_OUTCOME</data>
      <data key="d10">decision support</data>
      <data key="d8">Section 4: 'This was executed by the Cameo Simulation Toolkit ... which enabled end-to-end simulation of realistic mission scenarios. This enabled requirements verification for mission scenarios and the ability to perform trades on parameters such as orbit latitude, ground network size and distribution, and solar panel and battery sizes.' Section 6: 'The integrated model enabled the execution of trade studies to evaluate mission performance and verify that mission requirements would be satisfied.'</data>
