    <edge source="paper-0023::claim-07" target="outcomecategory::communication_stakeholder_alignment" id="e001082">
      <data key="d6">CLAIMS_OUTCOME</data>
      <data key="d10">communication/stakeholder alignment</data>
      <data key="d8">Conclusion: "To improve communication, planning, management, and development, we implemented this approach, replacing ad hoc procedures in the work organization with process flow and model based on the different views of the system architecture." Conclusion: "The proposed modeling also facilitated the development of key documents in a nanosatellite project, namely the product breakdown structure (PBS)" and "the PBS is considered as the backbone of the project design management activities allowing among other things to define the work breakdown structure (WBS) and the cost breakdown structure (CBS)."</data>
      <data key="d9">medium</data>
    </edge>
