      <data key="d6">CLAIMS_OUTCOME</data>
      <data key="d10">integrability/interoperability</data>
      <data key="d8">Conclusion: "The next step of this work is to improve the viability and practicality of the product breakdown structure model by integrating external analysis and simulation tools such as MATLAB and STK. The aim is to develop an executable SysML model with a graphical user interface to provide insight into how nanosatellites work."</data>
