    <edge source="paper-0033::claim-01" target="outcomecategory::decision_support" id="e001428">
      <data key="d6">CLAIMS_OUTCOME</data>
      <data key="d10">decision support</data>
      <data key="d8">From these graphs, we can infer that the power and data balances are stable, i.e. the satellite is capable of charging the batteries for the amount used each orbit, and download the generated mission data. This means, for this perspective, that this is a valid operation scenario.</data>
