    <edge source="paper-0033::claim-02" target="outcomecategory::automation" id="e001441">
      <data key="d6">CLAIMS_OUTCOME</data>
      <data key="d10">automation</data>
      <data key="d8">By using the MAM and automatically generating the input configuration script, the user is no longer required to understand how the simulator source code works, and does not have to manually code the configurations for each scenario, permitting a straightforward use of the simulator. Also, it is much more practical and faster to change scenario parameters in the model than manually in the configuration script</data>
      <data key="d9" />
    </edge>
