    <edge source="paper-0079::claim-06" target="outcomecategory::integrability_interoperability" id="e002398">
      <data key="d6">CLAIMS_OUTCOME</data>
      <data key="d10">integrability/interoperability</data>
      <data key="d8">A collaborative MBSE workspace/environment is provided. This workspace integrates discipline-specific models capable of performing all aspects of the system definition. With proper construction of Simulink models and wrap-up of engineering model and flight model of onboard software, this workspace even allows a seamless integration of requirement development, model verification, code automatic generation and verification with high efficiency and quality.</data>
      <data key="d9" />
    </edge>
